    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_advanced_conflict_resolver" kindref="compound">AdvancedConflictResolver</ref></para>
<para>Extends <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_i_conflict_resolver" kindref="compound">IConflictResolver</ref> with a richer <ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_advanced_conflict_resolver_1_1_resolution_context" kindref="compound">ResolutionContext</ref> so that application logic can take collection name, user roles, request timestamp, and arbitrary metadata into account when resolving a conflict.</para>
<para>Implementations MUST be stateless: every call to <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_advanced_conflict_resolver_1a33e26c20337a64ba1c08277ea3c3157e" kindref="member">resolve()</ref> must be idempotent and thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
